{'symbol': 'KMI', 'date': '2023-01-18 16:05:00', 'title': 'KINDER MORGAN REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER EARNINGS PER SHARE UP 7% AND DISTRIBUTABLE CASH FLOW PER SHARE UP 13% VERSUS THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021', 'text': "HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--KINDER MORGAN, INC.'S (NYSE: KMI) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY APPROVED A CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.2775 PER SHARE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ($1.11 ANNUALIZED), PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 15, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 31, 2023. THIS DIVIDEND IS A 3% INCREASE OVER THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021."}